  dialogue: {fileID: 0}
  callbacks: []
  introLines:
  - "Yurt acil, d\xF6nem ba\u015Fl\u0131yor. \u0130ki y\xFCz \xF6\u011Frenci kap\u0131da
    kalmas\u0131n."
  - "Siz onay\u0131 bas\u0131n, zahmetinize kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131k d\xF6rt bin.
    Kimse bir \u015Fey demez."
  questions:
  - question: Kolonlar neden kesik?
    answer: "Odalar geni\u015F olsun diye biraz a\xE7t\u0131k. Ta\u015F\u0131r {hitap},
      ta\u015F\u0131r."
  approvedLine: 
  shearWallLine: 
  rejectedLine: 
  rejectPressure:
  - condition: 0
    text: "Bir dakika. Acele etmeyin, bir daha d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCn."
  - condition: 1
    text: "Kira d\xFC\u015F\xFCnce kasan\u0131zda {kasa} kalacak. Evde {hazirlik}
      h\xE2l\xE2 yok; a\xE7\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131z {eksik}."
  - condition: 1
    text: "Bu d\xF6rt bin o a\xE7\u0131\u011F\u0131 kapat\u0131r. Bir baba ailesini
      korumaz m\u0131?"
  - condition: 2
    text: "K\u0131z\u0131n\u0131z geziye gidemedi diye duydum... Bir baba eli bo\u015F
      durur mu?"
  - condition: 4
    text: "Bu \u015Fehirde herkes beni tan\u0131r. Bug\xFCn reddedersiniz, yar\u0131n
      kap\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 kimse \xE7almaz."
  collapseHeadline: "\xD6\u011Frenci yurdu \xE7\xF6kt\xFC"
  standingLine: "\xD6\u011Frenci Yurdu ayakta."
